{"version":1,"content":"<p>據彭博社報道，Anthropic股價周五大跌，回吐了上市首日部分漲幅。在該公司創下史上最大規模IPO紀錄後，其股價走勢開始考驗投資者的信心。周五，Anthropic股價一度暴跌，幾乎跌至83美元的IPO發行價，隨後收窄跌幅，最終報收於每股88.91美元，較周四上市首日收盤價下跌8.5%。按此計算，Anthropic市值約為1.6萬億美元，位居全球市值最高的15家上市公司之列。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587390.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.195155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T10:03:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_hash":"8cb17411f290c1bb415710cc1a250fc838db9bfadb99f63caf3f8f7e7e3b2b1b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}